@startuml AgentPay System Context
!theme plain
title AgentPay — System Context

actor "API seller" as Seller
actor "Approver" as Approver
actor "Human buyer" as HumanBuyer
actor "Agent buyer" as AgentBuyer
rectangle "Seller coding agent\nClaude Code / Codex / MCP host" as CodingAgent
rectangle "AgentPay\nAutomated commerce gateway" as AgentPay
rectangle "Seller API" as SellerAPI
cloud "x402 facilitator\n(testnet)" as Facilitator
cloud "Human checkout provider\n(planned)" as HumanCheckout
cloud "AWS Bedrock" as Bedrock

Seller --> CodingAgent : Requests integration\nreviews changes and confirms publish
CodingAgent --> AgentPay : Scoped MCP resources and tools
Seller --> AgentPay : Configures products\nreviews unified sales/disputes
HumanBuyer --> AgentPay : Browses storefront\nchecks out and receives fulfillment
AgentBuyer --> AgentPay : Discovers offers\ncreates intent\npays through x402
Approver --> AgentPay : Reviews and approves/vetoes
AgentPay --> SellerAPI : Forwards one signed request
AgentPay --> Facilitator : Verifies/settles testnet payment
AgentPay --> HumanCheckout : Creates checkout\nverifies server callback
AgentPay --> Bedrock : Requests structured proposal/explanation
Bedrock --> AgentPay : Tool calls only\n(no wallet access)
@enduml
